    <statement><p>How many functions map <m>{\left\{1,2,3,4,5,6\right\}}</m> <em>onto</em> <m>{\left\{1,2,3,4,5\right\}}</m> (i.e., how many <em>surjections</em> are there)?</p>
<p><fillin characters="15" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>5^{6}-13825</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><p><m>4^6 - \left[{4 \choose 1}3^6 - {4 \choose 2}2^6 + {4 \choose 3} 1^6 \right]\text{.}</m></p>
</solution>
